     1327         apply "CHOOSE":U to b-sel in frame fr-D-rvs-doc-0.
     1328     end.
     1329   end.
     1330   on value-changed of br-rvs-docs in frame fr-D-rvs-doc-0 do:
     1331     run proc-view-changes in this-procedure no-error.
     1332   end.
     1333   on entry of sch-code in frame fr-D-rvs-doc-0 do:
